14\" id=\"item-61a5197b61b9581da5911944\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-e1af096e2d4dc811a520\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Join us for the return of our annual Winter Celebration!</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">As in years past, this event is free and open to the public.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">There will be a 2 hour open bar for people who have paid their 2022 membership dues. We strongly encourage you to pay in advance online:<br><a href=\"http://www.sdnyc.org/membership?fbclid=IwAR2CL1rlmb-P_RIbSMM2waT9BcJVYInvOLQ32VHicahLsXHiScorVdbWxic\" target=\"_blank\">www.SDNYC.org/membership</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">All the details are also on our Facebook Event Page:<a href=\"https://fb.me/e/ZSzs6Ixn\"> https://fb.me/e/ZSzs6Ixn</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We will be livestreaming remarks from the night on our Facebook Page: <a href=\"https://www.fb.com/sdnyc\">www.FB.com/SDNYC</a></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">COVID 19 Information: HUSH HK is following all City, State and Federal COVID-19 requirements and all attendees must present proof of vaccination to enter the venue.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Can't wait to see you on Dec. 7th!</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n</div></div></div></div></div>","excerpt":"","location":{"mapZoom":12.0,"mapLat":40.7143528,"mapLng":-74.0059731,"markerLat":40.7143528,"markerLng":-74.0059731,"addressTitle":"","addressLine1":"","addressLine2":"","addressCountry":""},"customContent":null,"likeCount":0,"commentCount":0,"publicCommentCount":0,"commentState":2,"unsaved":false,"author":{"id":"534c4a4fe4b0aea44780ee59","displayName